# Code-owner review is required on protected branches (int, qa, uat, main).
# Paths NOT listed here (reports, dashboards, list views, layouts, labels,
# static resources) have no owner, so agentic-lane PRs can auto-merge once
# checks pass. Business sign-off is separate: GitHub Environments, not CODEOWNERS.

