/force-app/**/profiles/           @your-org/salesforce-engineers @your-org/security
/force-app/**/permissionsets/     @your-org/salesforce-engineers @your-org/security
/force-app/**/sharingRules/       @your-org/salesforce-engineers @your-org/security
/force-app/**/namedCredentials/   @your-org/security
/force-app/**/connectedApps/      @your-org/security
/force-app/**/settings/           @your-org/security
/manifest/destructiveChanges*.xml @your-org/salesforce-engineers

